,"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:p033","text":"夷王崩，子厲王胡立。厲王即位三十年，好利，近榮夷公。大夫芮良夫諫厲王曰：「王室其將卑乎？夫榮公好專利而不知大難。夫利，百物之所生也，天地之所載也，而有專之，其害多矣。天地百物皆將取焉，何可專也？所怒甚多，不備大難。以是教王，王其能久乎？夫王人者，將導利而布之上下者也。使神人百物無不得極，猶日怵惕懼怨之來也。故《頌》曰『思文后稷，克配彼天，立我蒸民，莫匪爾極』。大雅曰『陳錫載周』。是不布利而懼難乎，故能載周以至于今。今王學專利，其可乎？匹夫專利，猶謂之盜，王而行之，其歸鮮矣。榮公若用，周必敗也。」厲王不聽，卒以榮公為卿士，用事。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"夷王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000207","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"厲王胡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000208","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000208","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"榮夷公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000209","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"芮良夫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000210","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000208","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"榮公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000209","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0239","start":239,"end":241,"surface":"榮公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000209","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0250","start":250,"end":252,"surface":"厲王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000208","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-004-zhou:m033-0257","start":257,"end":259,"surface":"榮公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000209","s